Presumably you still have a few charges left on the castle wand. (And
if you don't, use that magic marker to write a b?oCharging.) Wish
up another magic marker and write a bunch of b?EAs.  Check the armor
from the castle soldiers first if you haven't already; some of it
might be good.  If you can find a /poly, you might try polypiling the
castle loot to get a T-shirt.  If not, you may want to use a wish if
you really need the AC, but that's a matter of opinion.  Speed boots
are also worth a wish.  Enchant the items you're least likely to
replace; leave the cloak for last, since there are a lot of good uses
for that slot.

Once you've finished with equipment, start kicking sinks and foocubus
dance your way to lvl14+ so you can do the quest.


